<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f172a;
            --panel: #111827;
            --card: #1f2937;
            --muted: #94a3b8;
            --text: #e5e7eb;
            --primary: #22c55e;
            --primary-dark: #16a34a;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #020617, #111827 60%, #0f172a);
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 48px 24px;
        }

        .nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .brand {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: #062d12;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--white);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
        }

        .hero {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
            gap: 32px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin: 0 0 18px;
        }

        .lead {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            max-width: 620px;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 28px;
            box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .stats {
            display: grid;
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .stat {
            background: rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.95);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .label {
            display: block;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        }

        .value {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
            margin-top: 52px;
        }

        .feature {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .feature h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .feature p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero, .features {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .nav {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <nav class="nav">
            <div class="brand">FinTrack</div>
            <div class="actions">
                <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/login">Entrar</a>
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/register">Criar conta</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <section class="hero">
            <div>
                <h1>Controla as tuas finanças com clareza.</h1>
                <p class="lead">
                    Organiza receitas, despesas, contas e objetivos num único lugar para tomares decisões financeiras melhores.
                </p>
                <div class="actions">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/register">Começar agora</a>
                    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/login">Já tenho conta</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card stats">
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="label">Saldo total</span>
                    <div class="value">€ 8.450,00</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="label">Receitas</span>
                    <div class="value">€ 3.200,00</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="label">Despesas</span>
                    <div class="value">€ 1.980,00</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="features">
            <article class="feature">
                <h3>Contas em painel</h3>
                <p>Segue todas as tuas contas e saldos em tempo real com uma vista organizada.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature">
                <h3>Orçamentos</h3>
                <p>Define limites por categoria e acompanha rapidamente o que estás a gastar.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature">
                <h3>Objetivos</h3>
                <p>Cria metas de poupança e vê o teu progresso ao longo do tempo.</p>
            </article>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
